    "Fenuko Flow never sells your data or uses it for advertising, tracking, profiling, or training AI models.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenuko Flow never sells your data or uses it for advertising, tracking, profiling, or training AI models."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenuko Flow никогда не продаёт ваши данные и не использует их для рекламы, отслеживания, профилирования или обучения ИИ-моделей."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fenuko Flow sends what you choose to submit — your messages and any files you attach — to its own servers and to the AI provider handling your request. Text conversations run on [OpenAI](https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/); image and video generation run on [fal.ai](https://fal.ai/legal/privacy-policy).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenuko Flow sends what you choose to submit — your messages and any files you attach — to its own servers and to the AI provider handling your request. Text conversations run on [OpenAI](https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/); image and video generation run on [fal.ai](https://fal.ai/legal/privacy-policy)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenuko Flow передаёт то, что вы сами отправляете — сообщения и прикреплённые файлы — на свои серверы и провайдеру ИИ, который обрабатывает запрос. Переписка идёт через [OpenAI](https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/); генерация изображений и видео — через [fal.ai](https://fal.ai/legal/privacy-policy)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fenuko Flow — chat with AI, generate images and videos. https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fenuko-flow/id6805904639": {
